The first map is an open embedding, while the last map is a ${\mathbb{P}}^6$-bundle, so the composition is flat (and even smooth).

Recall the embedding of the Weil divisor ${\mathbb{Y}}_2 \times {\mathbb{P}}(W_2) \hookrightarrow {\mathscr{X}}_2 \times_{{\mathbb{P}}(W_1^\vee \otimes W_2^\vee)} {\mathbb{Y}}_2$ defined by~\eqref{diagram:yy-cx3}.
